# Job seeker stored attachments (reuse — do not reinvent)

One helper (`JobseekerStoredAttachmentHelper`) handles file I/O **and** link-table persistence. Pass a **link code** from `JobseekerAttachmentLinkCodes` so the correct table is targeted. One download controller: `JobseekerAttachmentsController`.

## Link codes → tables

| Code (`JobseekerAttachmentLinkCodes`) | Link table | Parent record |
|--------------------------------------|------------|---------------|
| `ProfileCv` (`"CV"`) | `ProfileAttachments` | `profileId` only |
| `EducationRecord` (`"EDUCATION"`) | `JobSeekerEducationAttachments` | `parentRecordId` = `JobSeekerEducations.Id` |

File bytes always go to `Attachments` + disk via `IJobseekerAttachmentStorage`.

Education **rows** (not files): `JobSeekerEducations` via `JobseekerProfileCompletionService`.

## Backend API (helper methods)

```csharp
JobseekerStoredAttachmentHelper.LoadLinkedAsync(context, storage, linkCode, profileId, parentRecordId?)
JobseekerStoredAttachmentHelper.UpsertLinkedAsync(context, storage, linkCode, profileId, parentRecordId?, dto, utcNow)
JobseekerStoredAttachmentHelper.DeleteLinkedAsync(context, storage, linkCode, profileId, parentRecordId?)
JobseekerStoredAttachmentHelper.IsCallerOwnedAsync(context, linkCode, attachmentId, callerProfileId)
JobseekerStoredAttachmentHelper.IsCallerOwnedAnyAsync(context, attachmentId, callerProfileId) // download
```

**New domain:** add a constant in `JobseekerAttachmentLinkCodes`, extend the `switch` in `JobseekerStoredAttachmentHelper.Links.cs`, and add ownership in `IsCallerOwnedAsync`.

## Controllers (do not split per domain)

| Route | Controller |
|-------|------------|
| `GET /api/jobseekers/attachments/{id}/download` | `JobseekerAttachmentsController` |
| Education CRUD | `JobseekerProfileCompletionController` |
| CV on general info | `JobseekerProfileGeneralController` |

## Save contract

Embed `dataUrl` + metadata in JSON on save. GET returns metadata only (`attachmentId`, `fileName`, `fileType`, `fileSize`). Remove = `Attachment: null` or empty `fileName`.

## Frontend

Use `readProfileRecordAttachment`, `mapStoredAttachmentRef`, `AttachmentDownloadService`, and `<app-job-opportunity-attachment-chips>` — see `file-download-component.mdc`.

See also: `real-api-implementation.mdc`, `api-profile-id-from-token.mdc`.
